      "writtenOn": "2026-02-03T14:18:14Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Could we find a different names for this? Persistent mapping in the D3D12/Vulkan/GL sense is a different feature.\n\nInstead this is an optimization to eagerly remap buffers to allow mapAsync+WaitAny(0) to complete the mapping future without taking locks, if the application previously ensured that all previous GPU operations using the buffer completed.\n\nLet\u0027s also clarify on the linked issue that this is not \"persistent mapping\".",
      "revId": "a335988ca841282f1e2ad9882553e5cee907d5f0",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "e47ff4b6_5bd7be81",
        "filename": "/COMMIT_MSG",
        "patchSetId": 17
      },
      "lineNbr": 9,
      "author": {
        "id": 1000002
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-02-03T14:18:14Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Could we do it unconditionally? It should be cheap.",
      "revId": "a335988ca841282f1e2ad9882553e5cee907d5f0",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "53725d1e_7ec6c326",
        "filename": "/COMMIT_MSG",
        "patchSetId": 17
      },
      "lineNbr": 9,
      "author": {
        "id": 1003501
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-02-03T14:40:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I want to do A/B test to see whether it\u0027s an improvement before we remove the other path. Mapping buffers all the time is not free. What if we map buffer but users never use it. Also in future, Graphite could use a buffer repeatedly in different Queue::Submit, forcing the buffer to map, unmapped constantly for nothing. Unfortunately, D3D11 doesn\u0027t have explicit `FlushMappedRange` function, hence every `Unmap` would result in a flush AFAIK.",
      "parentUuid": "e47ff4b6_5bd7be81",
      "revId": "a335988ca841282f1e2ad9882553e5cee907d5f0",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "0ff3d3c0_c94a7fb9",
        "filename": "/COMMIT_MSG",
        "patchSetId": 17
      },
      "lineNbr": 14,
      "author": {
        "id": 1000002
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-02-03T14:18:14Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Since this is not persistent mapping, we should still require the application to call `Buffer::Unmap` before using a buffer in a submit (and that seems to be the case in this CL). What happens is that in a previous CL we made the call to D3D11\u0027s Unmap function deferred until TrackUsage to avoid taking the recording context lock in UnmapImpl.",
      "revId": "a335988ca841282f1e2ad9882553e5cee907d5f0",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
